Skills section needs restructuring Listing "Linux" and "Postman" twice in the Tools row is a minor but noticeable oversight. Also, grouping tools more meaningfully (e.g., separating Cloud, DevOps, Databases) would improve readability.

Education is outdated as a focal point With 4 years of experience, your education section carries less weight. It can be condensed — the Intermediate (12th) row can likely be dropped entirely.

