You're on PowerShell — it doesn't support multiple folders in one mkdir command. Run them one by one:

powershell
mkdir ingestion
mkdir processing
mkdir llm_agent
mkdir api
mkdir frontend
mkdir infra
Or use this PowerShell-friendly single command:

powershell
"ingestion","processing","llm_agent","api","frontend","infra" | ForEach-Object { mkdir $_ }
